4.3.0: P4 WiFi review fixes (#329) and production-tail groundwork (#328) — route lab DHCP through wifi_driver_backend (not kernel/core/net), endian-safe macvlan IPv4 checksum, argv-based ip(8) for fl0 macvlan, FullMAC connect op validation, and WSL .wslconfig profile selection prefers the invoking Windows user before glob fallback.
